[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0521","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45781","title":"GNU GRUB2 UFS 文件系统堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 UFS 文件系统解析器在处理符号链接名称时，未对输入的字符串长度进行有效性校验，导致堆内存越界写入漏洞。攻击者需要具备本地高权限，通过挂载特制的 UFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，可能破坏系统数据完整性并绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 GRUB2 引导程序的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等。建议用户及时更新 GRUB2 至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45781"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至修复版本：Debian 用户升级至 2.06-3~deb11u7（bullseye）或 2.06-13+deb12u2（bookworm）；Ubuntu 用户安装对应安全更新；RHEL 用户安装 RHSA 更新。如无法立即升级，在 UEFI 安全启动环境中启用 Secure Boot 并确保 shim 已更新，限制本地攻击者加载恶意 grub 模块。补丁将 grub_ufs_lookup_symlink 中的 grub_strcpy 替换为 grub_strlcpy 以校验符号链接名长度，防止堆越界写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:16154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45781","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345857","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45781.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b14f5555ae5b53d86b7353a1ef112eb3496498f9/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45781","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45781.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45781.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0521.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0516","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45776","title":"GNU GRUB2 .mo文件解析整数溢出堆越界读写漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 grub_mofile_open() 函数在处理语言 .mo 文件时，未对内部缓冲区大小计算过程中的整数溢出进行正确校验，导致缓冲区分配大小计算溢出，进而引发堆越界读写。本地攻击者需具备高权限，通过加载特制的 .mo 语言文件触发该漏洞，可造成敏感数据泄露或关键数据覆写，甚至绕过安全启动（Secure Boot）保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 Grub2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45776"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:40Z","remediation":"立即更新 grub2 至修复版本：RHEL 9 升级至 grub2-2.06-104.el9_6 及以上（RHSA-2025:6990），RHEL 10 升级至 grub2-2.12-15.el10_0 及以上（RHSA-2025:16154）。其他发行版请更新至 grub2 最新补丁版本。更新后执行 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg` 重新生成引导配置，并重新安装 grub 到引导扇区（`grub2-install`），同时重新注册 Secure Boot 密钥以确保安全启动保护生效。临时缓解措施：限制物理控制台访问权限，仅允许受信任管理员操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:16154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45776","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2339182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45776.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/13599c523c76c621fa9bc4ca64223d269ca5155c/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45776","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45776.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45776.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0515","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45775","title":"GNU GRUB2 extcmd 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Grub2 引导加载程序中的 grub_extcmd_dispatcher() 函数在调用 grub_arg_list_alloc() 分配参数列表内存时，未对内存分配失败进行返回值检查。当内存分配失败时，空指针被传递给 parse_option() 函数进行处理，导致 Grub 崩溃或在罕见场景下破坏中断向量表（IVT）数据。该漏洞需要攻击者具有高权限且能够本地访问系统，攻击复杂度较高，影响使用 Grub2 的各类 Linux 发行版。攻击者可通过精心构造的引导配置触发内存分配失败，进而引发拒绝服务或潜在的数据损坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45775"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19Z","updated":"2026-07-20T06:16:20Z","remediation":"立即将 GRUB2 升级至包含上游提交 05be856a8c3aae41f5df90cab7796ab7ee34b872 的版本（该提交在 grub-core/commands/extcmd.c 的 grub_extcmd_dispatcher 函数中增加了对 grub_arg_list_alloc 返回值的 NULL 检查）。各发行版用户请安装对应的安全更新：RHEL 用户安装 RHSA 安全公告对应更新，Ubuntu 用户等待 grub2-unsigned/grub2-signed 包更新至修复版本。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地高权限用户对 GRUB 引导配置的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45775","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2337481","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45775.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d4334910758429a4752d1bf638835a207844ed7e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45775","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45775.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45775.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0514","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45774","title":"Grub2 JPEG解析器堆越界写入漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 JPEG 解析器在处理特制 JPEG 图片文件时存在堆越界写入漏洞。由于 JPEG 解析过程中对内部缓冲区边界检查不充分，攻击者可通过向系统加载特制的 JPEG 图片触发该漏洞，造成堆内存越界写入。成功利用此漏洞可能覆盖敏感数据，进而绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞需本地高权限访问，影响使用 Grub2 引导程序的各种 Linux 发行版。建议用户及时安装厂商提供的补丁更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45774"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T19:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:40Z","remediation":"将 grub2 升级至 2.12 以上版本。各发行版操作如下：RHEL 9 用户执行 `dnf update grub2` 升级至 grub2-1:2.06-104.el9_6 及以上版本（对应 RHSA-2025:6990）；Debian/Ubuntu 用户执行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc` 获取包含上游补丁的更新包；其他发行版更新 grub2 至含 commit 2c34af90 的版本。更新后执行 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg`（UEFI 环境下为 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg`）重新生成引导配置，并重启系统使修复生效。如无法立即更新，可启用 Secure Boot 并配置 shim 签名验证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45774","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2337461","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45774.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45774.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d4334910758429a4752d1bf638835a207844ed7e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45774","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-45774.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0544","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50609","title":"Fluent Bit OpenTelemetry输入插件空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 3.1.9 的 OpenTelemetry 输入插件存在空指针解引用漏洞。当该插件监听网络端口运行时，攻击者可向目标发送 Content-Length 为 0 的特制数据包，触发 process_payload_traces_proto_ng() 函数在处理过程中将 0 值传递给 cfl_sds_len 函数，该函数尝试对空指针进行类型转换导致程序崩溃。此漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击者只需能够访问 OpenTelemetry 端点即可实施拒绝服务攻击，影响 Fluent Bit 3.1.9 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50609"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T18:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Fluent Bit 至包含该修复的版本。官方已在 PR #9993 中修复此漏洞，修复合并于 2025-02-24，影响 master 及 v3.1/v3.2 分支。建议升级到 v3.1.10 以上、v3.2.x 最新版或 v4.2.5/v5.0.6 及以上版本（这些版本均包含该补丁）。如无法立即升级，可在 OpenTelemetry 输入插件前部署反向代理（如 Nginx），过滤掉 Content-Length 为 0 的请求，或在防火墙层面限制对 OpenTelemetry 端口的访问仅允许受信任来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/announcements/","https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit/releases","https://www.ebryx.com/blogs/exploring-cve-2024-50608-and-cve-2024-50609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50609.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/fluent-bit/CVE-2024-50609.patch","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-50609.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50609.json","https://github.com/aws/aws-for-fluent-bit/blob/ce0e9647aeaec00260d1226d24cffcbb31e438e1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp.json","https://github.com/newrelic/docs-website/blob/be7242319b00b39f868f7d8e1ef18f20d335a1b2/src/i18n/content/kr/docs/release-notes/fluentbit-release-notes/fluentbit-25-02-27.mdx","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0543","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50608","title":"Fluent Bit Prometheus Remote Write输入插件空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 3.1.9 版本的 Prometheus Remote Write 输入插件存在空指针解引用漏洞。当该插件运行并监听 IP 地址和端口时，攻击者可通过发送 Content-Length 为 0 的恶意数据包触发漏洞，导致服务器崩溃。漏洞根源在于 `process_payload_metrics_ng()` 函数处理 `Content-Length: 0` 时，将值 0 传递给 `cfl_sds_len` 函数，该函数试图对空指针进行类型转换引发空指针解引用。攻击者只需网络访问该端点即可发起远程拒绝服务攻击，无需身份认证。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50608"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T18:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:47Z","remediation":"升级 Fluent Bit 至 3.2.3 及以上版本（含 3.2.x 系列），或应用上游 PR #9993 的补丁（commit ed56831），在 prom_rw_prot.c 的 prom_rw_prot_handle_ng 函数中增加 Content-Length <= 0 和 body == NULL 的校验，返回 400 错误而非继续处理。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制 Prometheus Remote Write 输入插件的访问来源 IP，或在该插件前加反向代理对 Content-Length 为 0 的请求进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/announcements/","https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit/releases","https://www.ebryx.com/blogs/exploring-cve-2024-50608-and-cve-2024-50609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50608.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/fluent-bit/CVE-2024-50608.patch","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-50608.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50608.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp.json","https://github.com/newrelic/docs-website/blob/be7242319b00b39f868f7d8e1ef18f20d335a1b2/src/i18n/content/kr/docs/release-notes/fluentbit-release-notes/fluentbit-25-02-27.mdx","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-50608.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0543.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0543.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0653","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0653.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57970","title":"libarchive TAR 解析堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"libarchive 在处理 TAR 归档文件时，`archive_read_support_format_tar.c` 中的 `header_gnu_longlink` 函数存在堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞。当 TAR 文件中包含被截断的 GNU 长链接名（long linkname）时，解析逻辑未能正确处理截断边界，导致读取超出分配堆缓冲区范围的数据。本地攻击者可通过诱使用户解压特制的 TAR 归档文件触发该漏洞，造成进程崩溃或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 libarchive 3.7.7 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57970"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-16T04:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:20Z","remediation":"建议立即将 libarchive 升级至 3.8.5 及以上版本（该版本包含 PR #2422 的修复，于 2024 年 12 月 10 日合入主线）。各发行版用户请通过官方包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt update && apt upgrade libarchive，RHEL/CentOS 执行 yum update libarchive，Alpine 执行 apk upgrade libarchive。如无法立即升级，应避免使用 bsdtar 或 libarchive 解析不受信的 TAR 归档文件，并在应用层面对输入文件进行校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/issues/2415","https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/pull/2422","https://github.com/hashicorp/consul/blob/86018878f82642e919a0c86520f5893bd0e3ee50/.changelog/22409.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57970.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57970.json","https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/blob/b05161aa67d75ad84151a392f3e87156efd42842/docs/resources/changelogs/cloud/release-notes/25_06.mdx","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-57970","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/l/libarchive/libarchive.spec","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/8ecd0a8b6df901f448daf84fcdff97aa070dbb78/main/libarchive/APKBUILD","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-57970.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57970.json","https://github.com/oracle/container-images/blob/0984eea600dbfefa7eddff7910b03361f67513d5/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0653.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0497","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-3220","title":"Python CPython mimetypes 模块不可信搜索路径漏洞","description":"CPython 标准库 mimetypes 模块在 Windows 平台上存在不安全的默认搜索路径缺陷。该模块将 Linux/macOS 上的默认 MIME 类型文件路径（如 /etc/mime.types）直接沿用至 Windows 系统，导致这些路径变为用户可写入位置（C:\\etc\\mime.types）。本地低权限攻击者可利用此缺陷创建恶意文件，在 Python 运行时启动时触发 MemoryError 导致拒绝服务，或使文件扩展名被错误解析为不正确的文件类型。该漏洞影响所有使用 CPython 的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 2.3，危害等级低。建议用户在 Windows 平台上调用 mimetypes.init([]) 传入空列表以规避默认路径。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-3220"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-14T17:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:43:33Z","remediation":"升级至 Python 3.14.0 或更高版本，此版本已修复 mimetypes 模块在 Windows 上误用 Unix 默认路径的问题。如无法升级，可在 Windows 平台调用 mimetypes.init([]) 传入空列表以避免使用默认的已知文件位置列表作为临时缓解措施。此外建议删除 C:\\etc\\mime.types 等可能被利用的恶意文件并限制 C:\\etc 目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/CDXW34ND2LSAOYAR5N6UNONP4ZBX4D6R/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/14/8","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250314-0001/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2024/3xxx/CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-32206.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/acd6946b811240fd9eb8b4695a0847eda8db127d/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-3220","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/f57e06c0c7b224221d0799ea8cea7dd8215a9a29/osv/python/CVE-2024-3220.json.sha512","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-32205.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-3220.md","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2025/python/gb_python_CVE-2024-3220_win.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-3220-2025-04-05-2005","https://github.com/Lucky-lm/CVE-2024-32205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0497.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0652","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0652.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57951","title":"Linux 内核 hrtimers 热插拔 CPU 状态处理不当释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核高精度定时器（hrtimers）子系统在 CPU 热插拔场景下存在状态处理缺陷。当 CPU 从在线状态经热卸载降至 CPUHP_HRTIMERS_PREPARE 阶段再恢复在线时，hrtimers_prepare_cpu() 回调未执行，导致 cpu_base.hres_active 标志位持续置位，而 tick 和 clockevents 已在卸载过程中关闭。恢复后 CFS 调度器错误认为 hrtick 已激活，clockevent 设备永久失去切换为 oneshot 模式的时机，同时 cpu_base.online 未正确置位触发内核警告，且部分 per-CPU 状态未重置可能遗留悬空指针。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可利用此漏洞触发系统崩溃或潜在权限提升，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57951"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T14:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：4.20+、5.4.290+、5.10.234+、5.15.177+、6.1.127+、6.6.74+ 或 6.12.11+。对应发行版请安装相应安全更新：Debian 11 安装 DLA-4075-1 更新，Ubuntu 安装 USN-7459-1 更新。Siemens 设备（SCALANCE/SIMATIC S7-1500 等）升级固件至 V3.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户登录和禁用 CPU 热插拔功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/14984139f1f2768883332965db566ef26db609e7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15b453db41d36184cf0ccc21e7df624014ab6a1a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f8dea1692eef2b7ba6a256246ed82c365fdc686","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38492f6ee883c7b1d33338bf531a62cff69b4b28","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d41dbf82e10c44e53ea602398ab002baec27e75","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95e4f62df23f4df1ce6ef897d44b8e23c260921a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a5cbbea145b400e40540c34816d16d36e0374fbc","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-355557.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57951.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57951.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57951","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57951.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57951.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57951.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57951.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57951-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-5j5f-9wh9-hfj9/GHSA-5j5f-9wh9-hfj9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57951"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0652.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0483","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12797","title":"OpenSSL RFC7250 原始公钥服务器认证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 的 RFC7250 原始公钥（RPK）认证实现存在安全缺陷，当 TLS 客户端启用 SSL_VERIFY_PEER 验证模式且服务器发送的 RPK 与预期公钥不匹配时，握手未按预期中止，导致客户端无法感知服务器身份验证失败。攻击者可在中间人位置利用此缺陷绕过认证，实施中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 OpenSSL 3.2 及以上版本（FIPS 模块不受影响），CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12797"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 3.4.1（3.4 分支）、3.3.3（3.3 分支）或 3.2.4（3.2 分支）版本，其中包含针对 RPK 握手验证失败的修复。若无法立即升级，作为临时缓解措施，可禁用服务器端 Raw Public Key（RPK）功能（RPK 默认关闭，无需额外操作），或在客户端调用 SSL_get_verify_result() 手动检查验证结果。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/738d4f9fdeaad57660dcba50a619fafced3fd5e9","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/798779d43494549b611233f92652f0da5328fbe7","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/87ebd203feffcf92ad5889df92f90bb0ee10a699","https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20250211.txt","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/11/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/11/4","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250214-0001/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12797.md","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/3bfec52fbacd342fd7cbae846c60f9e7a926fe84/security/vex/fleet/CVE-2024-12797.vex.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-02/CVE-2024-12797%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/ba2f3b557a660cbe2a0fc0e99b1830cb930a090f/NEWS.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12797.json","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/blob/c8f7e9ab9b833333ac9d8d3d16e31878c58aab3e/doc/topics/releases/3006.10.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/blob/e73c76d83b609cd5c387833e2467dbb52df06e46/docs/guide/configuration/reporting.md","https://github.com/google/boringssl/blob/bbae15127720290fb1216cf5a933a4bda6abf323/docs/advisories/2025-02-11.md","https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/6e3b4eab87bc1ec9e58d76361507e9e0be27dd4f/src/azure-cli-core/HISTORY.rst","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/cryptography/CVE-2024-12797.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0651","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0651.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57950","title":"Linux 内核 DRM/AMD 显示子系统除零错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMD 显示驱动（drm/amd/display）中存在除零漏洞。由于分母变量未初始化为非零默认值，当这些变量未被赋予其他值时，将触发除零错误（DIVIDE_BY_ZERO），导致内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞由 Coverity 静态分析工具发现，攻击者需要具有本地低权限访问才能触发，影响系统可用性。Linux 内核上游已通过将分母默认值初始化为 1 的方式修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57950"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:18Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 e2c4c6c10542 的版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户应升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1013-azure 或更新版本（USN-7448-1）；Ubuntu 24.10 用户升级至同版本。其他发行版用户应更新至主线内核 6.13 或厂商提供的包含该补丁的稳定内核版本。更新后需重启系统生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36b23e3baf9129d5b6c3a3a85b6b7ffb75ae287c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c9d6afb4f9c338049662d27d169fba7dd60e337d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57950.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57950.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57950.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c