poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0472","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0472.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11831","title":"npm serialize-javascript 跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞","description":"serialize-javascript npm 包存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于该模块未能正确过滤正则表达式等 JavaScript 对象类型输入，攻击者可向序列化数据中注入恶意代码，当浏览器反序列化时触发执行。该漏洞影响使用 serialize-javascript 处理用户数据的 Node.js Web 应用，可能导致敏感信息窃取或会话劫持。攻击者仅需诱导目标访问包含恶意序列化数据的页面即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11831"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:37Z","updated":"2026-07-20T05:16:21Z","remediation":"将 npm 包 serialize-javascript 升级至 6.0.2 或更高版本（最新版 v7.0.7），修复提交为 f27d65d3。在 package.json 中将依赖版本锁定为 \"^6.0.2\" 后执行 npm install 更新。如无法立即升级，在反序列化用户可控数据前使用 DOMPurify 等库对输出进行转义过滤，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:0304","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0381","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:10853","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1334","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1468","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:21068","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:21203","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:3870","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:4511","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8059","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8078","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8233","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8479","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8512","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8544","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8551","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:9294","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1536","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2769","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8568","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-11831","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2312579","https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/commit/f27d65d3de42affe2aac14607066c293891cec4e","https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/173","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-11831.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-11831","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/serialize-javascript/CVE-2024-11831.yml","https://github.com/microsoft/garnet/blob/55c9884e431c0f6de62bf18cf919defd2de3cf95/website/package.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2024/CVE-2024-11831.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/mathworks/MATLAB-extension-for-vscode/blob/c7168a97a816202aa1606313f12e83daa7f2a910/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-11831"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0472.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0479","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12243","title":"GnuTLS libtasn1 DER解码远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GnuTLS 依赖 libtasn1 处理 ASN.1 数据。由于 libtasn1 中 DER 解码算法存在复杂度缺陷，解析包含大量 subject alternative name 或 name constraint 字段的特制 X.509 证书时 CPU 消耗急剧上升。远程攻击者可发送恶意证书使 GnuTLS 服务 CPU 占用达 100%，导致响应缓慢或完全不可用，构成拒绝服务（DoS）风险。CVSS 3.1 评分 5.3，中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12243"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"2025-02-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 GnuTLS 升级至 3.8.8 或更高版本（3.8.0~3.8.7 均受影响，3.8.9 及以上不受影响）。RHEL 8 用户安装 RHSA-2025:4051 提供的 gnutls-3.6.16-8.el8_10.3 或更新版本；RHEL 9 用户安装 RHSA-2025:7076 提供的 gnutls-3.8.3-6.el9 或更新版本；RHEL 7 用户参考 RHSA-2025:17361。Debian 用户参考 DLA-4075-1。Siemens 设备用户关注 SSA-082556 和 SSA-202008。临时措施：在网络边界部署 TLS 拦截代理，限制单个证书中 SAN 及 name constraint 字段数量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:17361","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:4051","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:7076","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8020","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8385","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12243","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2344615","https://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/issues/1553","https://gitlab.com/gnutls/libtasn1/-/issues/52","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00027.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0002/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-202008.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0650","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0650.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57949","title":"Linux kernel irqchip GICv3 ITS 中断嵌套使能导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 GICv3 中断控制器 ITS 驱动中存在不正确的锁操作漏洞。函数 `its_irq_set_vcpu_affinity()` 使用 `guard(raw_spinlock_irq)` 宏，该宏在作用域退出时会重新启用中断，但调用链 `irq_set_vcpu_affinity()` → `irq_get_desc_lock()` 已通过 `raw_spin_lock_irqsave()` 在关闭中断的状态下持有自旋锁。这导致在 `irq_put_desc_unlock()` 中检测到中断被意外启用而触发内核警告。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞造成内核拒绝服务（系统不稳定或崩溃），影响 Linux 内核 6.1.95 至 6.1.127、6.6.35 至 6.6.74、6.9.6 至 6.12.11 等多个版本。该漏洞不影响系统机密性和完整性，但可用性影响为高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57949"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-09T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或 6.13 及以上。Debian 用户请参考 DLA-4051-1 公告更新内核包。如无法立即升级，可考虑在 affected 版本中禁用 GICv3 ITS 中断重映射功能（内核启动参数添加 irqchip.gicv3_its=disable），但会降低中断性能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/35cb2c6ce7da545f3b5cb1e6473ad7c3a6f08310","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6c84ff2e788fce0099ee3e71a3ed258b1ca1a223","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93955a7788121ab5a0f7f27e988b2ed1135a4866","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7b0e89610dd45ac6cf0d6f99bfa9ccc787db344","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57949.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57949.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57949.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57949","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57949.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57949.md","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-57949/CVE-2024-57949.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57949.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57949-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisorie